 "response": "Lastal's budget is now **$1025K**: the $2610K set in #0001 plus all net changes that remain in effect (\u2212$1585K).\n\n**Method**\n\n- **Authority:** Only Finance Office budget entries count. Other teams' messages and Finance notes that don't change the budget (audits, receipts, cost-centre codes) were ignored.\n- **Withdrawal chains:** Each chain was followed to its last link. An odd number of links means the original update is withdrawn; an even number means it is restored.\n  - #0005 is withdrawn. #0062 withdraws #0015, which had withdrawn #0008, so #0008's withdrawal of #0005 stands.\n  - #0007 is restored. The chain #0919 \u2192 #0784 \u2192 #0142 \u2192 #0054 \u2192 #0050 \u2192 #0044 has six links.\n  - #0462 is restored. #1505 cancels #1330, which reinstates #1090, which cancels #0934's withdrawal of #0462.\n  - About 115 updates end up withdrawn in total, including #0003, #0024, #0038, #0094, #0147, #0257, #0356, #0647, #0783 and #0207.\n- **Calculation:** Starting from $2610K, every remaining increase and decrease was applied once, in record order.\n\nThis is a single sequential pass with no independent recount, so an error in transcribing one of the many entries cannot be ruled out.\n\nANSWER: $1025K",
